From 3f2b99f8b15911f10e146c7e43dab8b31c71998a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 14:45:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/35] GENIO: media: platform: mtk-mdp3: add MT8195 MDP
 component selection algorithms

To gradually reduce platform dependence on SCP, add more PQ-related MDP
component selection algorithms in the kernel. This builds on the existing
set of migrated components and expands support for MT8195.

Change-Id: If6af45862a96b8ba502b26cdf8d55f81d44e9256
Signed-off-by: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
